<title>JAPAN: Arrk's overseas units to boost capital.</title>
<headline>Arrk's overseas units to boost capital.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arrk Corp said on Tuesday that its wholly owned overseas units would increase their capital in December.</p>
<p>U.S. unit Arrk Creative Network Corp would increase its capital to $4 million from $3.5 million and Arrk Europe Ltd, which is based in Britain, would increase its to 600,000 pounds from 310,000 pounds, Arrk said in a statement.</p>
<p>Arrk Corp (Thailand) Ltd would raise its capital to 80 million baht from 66 million, Arrk said.</p>
</text>
